<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stone raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stone raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating of Stone Container Corp to buy from hold, a market source said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened up 5/8 to 14-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730  </p>
<p>-- Prudential later verified the rating change.</p>
</text>
